      "sourceTextSha256": "c3972681ca9d6c86bcdfc5e5b901f20e3049d7c444dd5d96bf4efe856debcfd1",
      "text": "7 February · A relaxed morning; in the afternoon, a 30-minute helicopter flight over Rio: the ocean, forested mountains, beaches and yachts, Christ the Redeemer, the Botanical Garden, the lagoon, Leblon, Ipanema, Copacabana and Sugar Loaf. In the evening, the Carnival at the Sambadrome, in a private frisa for six in Sector 4, row A or B, with private transfer and guide: watch the top samba schools parade in all their splendour, and leave whenever you wish.",
